 "_about": "Which Wikidata item stands for a map territory in which years, for states whose name on the map covers several regimes (Germany 1919-2019 is the Weimar Republic, Nazi Germany, occupied Germany, West Germany and today's Germany). Written for GeoHistory from general knowledge. Each row is [first year, last year, English Wikipedia title]. tools/context/fetch_context.py resolves every title to its Wikidata item and compares the years with the item's inception (P571) and dissolution (P576); a row is verified when it lies within the item's years (2 years of slack; an item without a dissolution date is still in being). The government form, official religion and parties for those years are read from that item. Years outside every row fall back to the territory's own Wikidata item.",
